flowchart TD
  A[Threat model and attack corpus] --> B[Untrusted input boundary]
  B --> C{Prompt or retrieval injection?}
  C -->|yes| D[Quarantine as untrusted evidence]
  C -->|no| E[Continue normal evidence path]
  D --> F[Server-side policy enforcement]
  E --> F
  F --> G{Tool identity scope tenant schema approval}
  G -->|deny| H[Block before side effect]
  G -->|allow| I[Bounded tool adapter]
  I --> J[Output and canary inspection]
  J --> K[Budget and artifact integrity checks]
  H --> L[Redacted audit evidence]
  K --> L
  L --> M{Critical attack contained?}
  M -->|no| N[Fail release gate]
  M -->|yes| O[Regression suite and remediation]
